        "description": "<p><img src=\"https://fotos.perfil.com/2026/01/13/trim/540/304/venezuela-kirchners-chavez-art-2168885.jpg\" alt=\"Venezuela, Kirchners, Chavez, ART\" /></p>Argentina\u2019s economic relationship with the Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela left a negative balance difficult to hide. From Hugo Ch\u00e1vez\u2019s financial loans to N\u00e9stor Kirchner to failed trade agreements, expropriations and non-payments, the link translated into lost dollars, lost markets and troubled national companies. Bonds with usurious interest rates, unpaid exports, truncated energy projects and forced nationalisations marked almost three decades of a political alliance which, in economic terms, proved to be costly and ruinous for the country. <a href=\"https://www.batimes.com.ar/news/opinion-and-analysis/the-fall-of-the-bolivarian-regime-and-its-ruinous-fallout-for-argentina.phtml\">Leer m\u00e1s</a>",
